        "text": "If equipped with a Tidewall defence platform, this Fortification has a Wounds characteristic of 15."
      },
      "Ability§Titan Hunter": {
        "assets": {
          "traits": [
            {
              "item": "Ability§Anti-",
              "stats": {
                "keyword": {
                  "value": "titan"
                },
                "x": {
                  "value": "3+"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "text": "This model’s twin heavy rail cannon and seeker missiles have the [ANTI-TITANIC 3+] ability while targeting a unit within half range."
      },
      "Ability§Titan-killer": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack that targets a Titanic or Towering unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Trail Finding": {
        "text": "Once per turn, when an enemy unit ends a Normal,Advance or Fall Back move within 9″ of this model’s unit, if this models unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to D6."
      },
      "Ability§Transport": {
        "text": "This model has a transport capacity of 48 T’au Empire Infantry models. This model can also transport up to 6 Battlesuit models (these models take up the space of a number of models equal to their Wounds characteristic, e.g. a Battlesuit with a Wounds characteristic of 8 would take up the space of 8 models). This model cannot transport Kroot or Vespid Stingwings models."
      },
      "Ability§Transport Bay": {
        "allowed": {
          "items": [
            "Model§Tactical Drones"
          ]
        },
        "assets": {
          "included": [
            {
              "item": "Model§Tactical Drones",
              "quantity": 12
            }
          ],
          "traits": [
            "Ability§Transport"
          ]
        },
        "text": "The bearer has the Transport keyword and has a transport capacity of 12 Tactical Drones models"
      },
      "Ability§Turbo-jets": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6″ to the Move characteristic of models in this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Velocity Tracker": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack with a ranged weapon that targets a unit that can Fly, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Volley Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit."
      },
      "Ability§War Leader": {
        "text": "Once per battle round, one unit from your army with this ability can be targeted with a Strategem for 0CP, even if another unit from your army has already been targeted with that Strategem this phase."
      },
      "Ability§Way of the Short Blade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit within 9″, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Weapon Support System": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time the bearer makes a ranged attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Xv02 Pilot Battlesuit": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Command phase, you can select one friendly Hammerhead Gunship unit within 12″. Until the start of your next Command phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability."
      },
