        "text": "**KILLING BLOW**\n\nDuring the first, second and third battle rounds, ranged weapons equipped by **T’AU EMPIRE** models from your army have the **[ASSAULT]** ability. During the first, second and third battle rounds, while a unit is a Guided unit (see For the Greater Good), its ranged weapons have the **[LETHAL HITS]** ability."
      },
