        "text": "**BONDED HEROES**\n\nEach time a **T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT** model from your army makes a ranged attack that targets a unit within 12\", improve the Strength characteristic of that attack by 1. If that attack targets a unit within 8\", improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1 as well."
      },
