      "Stratagem§A Tempting Trap": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kauyon"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. The first time you use this Stratagem, you must also select one objective marker that is not in your opponent’s deployment zone; until the end of the battle, this becomes your Trap objective marker.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within range of your Trap objective marker, add 1 to the Wound roll.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot use this Stratagem during the first or second battle rounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§A Trap Well Laid": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kroot Hunting Pack"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KROOT** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** After your unit has resolved its attacks this phase, select one enemy unit that was hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time a **KROOT** model from your army makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, unless the attacking unit is Battle-shocked, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Aggressive Mobility": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Mont’ka"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE** unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, if your unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6\" to the Move characteristic of models in your unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Alien Expertise": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Auxiliary Cadre"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **KROOT/VESPID STINGWINGS** unit is selected to make an **advance move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KROOT/VESPID STINGWINGS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to declare a charge**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Combat Debarkation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Mont’ka"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY** unit from your army that disembarked from a **TRANSPORT** this turn.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets the closest enemy unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Combat Embarkation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kauyon"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY** unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge, and one friendly **TRANSPORT**.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit embarks within that **TRANSPORT**.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Every model in your **INFANTRY** unit must be within 3\" of that **TRANSPORT** and there must be sufficient transport capacity to embark the entire unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Coordinate to Engage": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kauyon"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE** unit from your army that has just been selected as an Observer unit (see For the Greater Good).\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets their Spotted unit, improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of that attack by 1 and, if your unit has the **Markerlight** keyword, that attack has the **[IGNORES COVER]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Counterfire Defence Systems": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Mont’ka"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§EMP Grenades": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kroot Hunting Pack"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy **VEHICLE** unit is selected to shoot or fight.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KROOT GRENADES** unit from your army within 8\" of that enemy **VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, worsen the Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics of that enemy **VEHICLE** unit’s weapons by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Experimental Ammunition": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Experimental Prototype Cadre"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **BATTLESUIT CHARACTER** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **BATTLESUIT CHARACTER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks have:\n\n- +1 **S**.\n\n- __Or:__ +1 **S**, **AP** and **[HAZARDOUS]**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Experimental Modifications": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Auxiliary Cadre"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly **KROOT/VESPID STINGWINGS** unit is **selected to attack**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KROOT/VESPID STINGWINGS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s attacks have +1 **AP**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fail-Safe Detonator": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Retaliation Cadre"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a **T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT** model from your army is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** That destroyed model’s unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even if that unit was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Before removing your model from play, if it has the Deadly Demise ability, do not roll for that ability; instead, you can choose whether the result of that roll is a 1 or a 6. If your model does not have the Deadly Demise ability, roll one D6 for each unit within 6\" of it: on a 4+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Focused Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Mont’ka"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Two **T’AU EMPIRE** units from your army that have not been selected to shoot this phase, and one enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in either of your units makes an attack, it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target for that attack), and when resolving that attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic by 1.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot use this Stratagem during the fourth or fifth battle rounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Grav-Inhibitor Field": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Retaliation Cadre"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT** unit from your army that was selected as a target of that charge.\n\n**EFFECT:** That enemy unit must immediately take a Battle-shock test and you must roll one D6 for each model in that enemy unit: for each 6, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound."
      },
      "Stratagem§Guerrilla Warriors": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kroot Hunting Pack"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **KROOT** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KROOT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hidden Hunters": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kroot Hunting Pack"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KROOT** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Join the Hunt": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kroot Hunting Pack"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KROOT INFANTRY** or **KROOT HOUNDS** unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed **CHARACTER** units to Attached units. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle."
      },
      "Stratagem§Photon Grenades": {
        "keywords": {
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kauyon"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's charge phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its **charge target**.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE GRENADES** unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge.\n\n**EFFECT:** That enemy unit must immediately take a Battle-shock test, and until the end of the phase, subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that enemy unit.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot target a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Pinpoint Counter-Offensive": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Mont’ka"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE** unit (excluding **KROOT** units) from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the battle, each time a **T’AU EMPIRE** unit (excluding **KROOT** units) from your army makes an attack that targets the enemy unit that just destroyed your unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Point-blank Ambush": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kauyon"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within 9\", improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot use this Stratagem during the first or second battle rounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Pulse Onslaught": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Mont’ka"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY** unit (excluding **KROOT** units) from your army that has just shot, and one enemy unit (excluding **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES**) hit by one or more of those attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of your opponent’s next turn, that enemy unit is shaken. While a unit is shaken, subtract 2 from its Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Advance and Charge rolls made for it."
      },
      "Stratagem§Stimm Injectors": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Retaliation Cadre"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§The Arro’kon Protocol": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Retaliation Cadre"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that contains 6 or more models, that attack has the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability. If that attack targets an enemy unit that contains 11 or more models, it has the **[SUSTAINED HITS 2]** ability instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§The Grisly Feast": {
        "keywords": {
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kroot Hunting Pack"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KROOT** unit from your army that destroyed one or more enemy units this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit within 6\" of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. If the unit taking that test is Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. Enemy units affected by this Stratagem do not need to take any other Battle-shock tests in the same phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§The Shortened Blade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Retaliation Cadre"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT** unit from your  army that is arriving using the Deep Strike ability this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy models.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** A unit targeted with this Stratagem is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§The Torchstar Gambit": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Retaliation Cadre"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **T’AU EMPIRE BATTLESUIT** unit from your army that can **FLY** whose attacks have been resolved this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** If your unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move. If it does, your unit cannot declare a charge this turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Wall of Mirrors": {
        "keywords": {
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "T’au Empire",
            "Kauyon"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **STEALTH**, **GHOSTKEEL** or **COMMANDER SHADOWSUN** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot target a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
